[49.148109, "o", "\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r"]
[49.150201, "o", "python3 run_tests.py\r\n"]
[49.210289, "o", "All tests use the stand-in model (stand_in_model.py), NOT a real AI model.\r\n\r\n"]
[49.212405, "o", "[PASS] Test 1a  no fixes: the planted note creates a ticket\r\n[PASS] Test 1b  no fixes: the reply links to the attacker, with the summary in the URL\r\n[PASS] Test 1c  no fixes: the reply leaks the system-prompt canary\r\n"]
[49.213184, "o", "[PASS] Test 1d  no fixes: an INVISIBLE note creates a ticket too\r\n[PASS] Test 2a  label: the email cannot fake the closing marker\r\n[PASS] Test 2b  label: the marker is random for every request\r\n"]
[49.213813, "o", "[PASS] Test 2c  label: invisible characters are stripped, so the hidden note has no effect\r\n"]
[49.214641, "o", "[PASS] Test 2d  label ALONE does not stop a visible note on a worst-case model (expected: ticket still created)\r\n"]
[49.215285, "o", "[PASS] Test 2e  plan: the model's typed tool call is ignored and logged\r\n[PASS] Test 2f  plan ALONE does not stop the data leak in the reply (expected: attacker link still there)\r\n"]
[49.216082, "o", "[PASS] Test 2g  plan: when the agent asks for a ticket, CODE builds it from the email headers\r\n"]
[49.216912, "o", "[PASS] Test 2h  confirm: nothing is created until a person approves\r\n[PASS] Test 2i  confirm: the person sees the exact action and who asked for it\r\n"]
[49.217407, "o", "[PASS] Test 2j  confirm: approving runs exactly the shown action (so a careless 'yes' still hurts)\r\n"]
[49.218456, "o", "[PASS] Test 2k  output: the attacker link is removed and the canary leak is caught\r\n[PASS] Test 2l  output ALONE does not stop the tool call (expected: ticket still created)\r\n"]
[49.218564, "o", "[PASS] Test 2m  output: images are removed, allow-listed links are kept\r\n"]
[49.218721, "o", "[PASS] Test 2n  output: a reference-style markdown link is caught too\r\n[PASS] Test 2o  output: invisible characters in the reply are stripped, so a split canary is still caught\r\n"]
[49.219463, "o", "[PASS] Test 3   all fixes, 03_planted_note.txt: no ticket, no pending action, no attacker link, no canary\r\n"]
[49.220063, "o", "[PASS] Test 3   all fixes, 04_hidden_unicode.txt: no ticket, no pending action, no attacker link, no canary\r\n[PASS] Test 3   all fixes: the alert is in logs/events.jsonl for the SOC\r\n"]
[49.220572, "o", "[PASS] Test 3   all fixes, 01_normal.txt: a normal email still gets a normal summary and no alerts\r\n"]
[49.221058, "o", "[PASS] Test 3   all fixes, 02_normal.txt: a normal email still gets a normal summary and no alerts\r\n"]
[49.286932, "o", "[PASS] Test 4   the server refuses to listen on 0.0.0.0\r\n\r\n25 of 25 checks passed\r\nALL TESTS PASSED\r\n"]
